  "content": {
    "text": "CONCLUDED\n3 hours ago\nThis Risk ETF Is Riding Its Best Seven-Day Stretch in a Year\nAn exchange-traded fund focused on riskier S&P 500 stocks is riding its best seven-day stretch in a year.\nThe Invesco S&P 500 High Beta ETF, which offers exposure to some of the most volatile stocks in the S&P 500, is up another 1%. It’s on pace for a fresh closing high.\nThe ETF, which goes by the ticker SPHB, is up for a seventh day in a row. It’s gained nearly 12% in that span, its best seven-day stretch since April 30, 2025, according to Dow Jones Market Data.",
